      overview: "A hike through Southern Pare Mountains takes visitors through local villages and beautiful forests, and offers an opportunity to explore roads less traveled. On the top of Mountains to Chome Forest reserve, which is a dense tropical forest with many rare trees and plants. Hikes through the mountains can be a day or multi-day trips and can also be combined with a trip to Mkomazi National Park and Lake Jipe.",
