          title: "Arrival Day – Arusha /Moshi Town",
          summary: "Pick up from Kilimanjaro airport and transfer to hotel in Moshi / Arusha. A pre-climb briefing can be organized where we will provide you all the information to prepare for your climb. This will include a day to day guide of your climb, the gear required as well as discussing acute mountain sickness and all health and safety on Kilimanjaro.",
